The  command  displays  or sets various video system driver vari‐
ables.  If a list of variables is present on  the  command  line,
then  prints  the current value of those variables for the speci‐
fied device.  If the flag is specified, all variables for the de‐
vice are printed.  If the flag is specified attempts to  set  the
specified variables to the given values.  The flag can be used to
specify an alternate video device.  If is not specified, is used.
